WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Two boxes sit side by side. One says, "How focused did I feel?"
The other says, "What did I actually finish?"

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
A person starts a task and a timer counts twelve minutes.
The feeling of focus and the work done might not match.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
An audio seller can describe short sessions.
That tells us its format, not how well it works for you.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
To make a scientific claim, the exact program needs
a useful comparison and a relevant outcome.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Try a free twelve-minute task. Write down what you complete.
Note separately how focused you felt.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Keep the evidence separate from the promise.
Read the independent guide, then decide whether any product is worth your money.
